# 中频词汇 List03
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List03核心词汇

{{boundary}}{/ˈbaʊndri/}{边界；界限}{The river forms the boundary between the two countries.}}
{{branch}}{/brɑːntʃ/}{分支；树枝}{The bank has branches across the country.}}
{{breach}}{/briːtʃ/}{违反；缺口}{The company was fined for breach of contract.}}
{{brief}}{/briːf/}{简短的；简报}{The manager gave a brief overview of the project.}}
{{brilliant}}{/ˈbrɪliənt/}{杰出的；灿烂的}{She came up with a brilliant solution to the problem.}}
{{broad}}{/brɔːd/}{广泛的；宽阔的}{The policy has broad support from the public.}}
{{budget}}{/ˈbʌdʒɪt/}{预算；编预算}{The government increased the education budget this year.}}
{{burden}}{/ˈbɜːdn/}{负担；重担}{The tax burden falls mainly on middle-income families.}}
{{campaign}}{/kæmˈpeɪn/}{运动；战役}{The advertising campaign was a huge success.}}
{{candidate}}{/ˈkændɪdət/}{候选人；应试者}{The candidate impressed the interviewers with her skills.}}
{{capable}}{/ˈkeɪpəbl/}{有能力的}{She is capable of leading the team to success.}}
{{career}}{/kəˈrɪər/}{职业；生涯}{He pursued a career in computer science.}}
{{cast}}{/kɑːst/}{投；演员阵容}{The movie has an impressive cast of actors.}}
{{casual}}{/ˈkæʒuəl/}{随意的；非正式的}{The dress code is casual on Fridays.}}
{{category}}{/ˈkætəɡəri/}{类别；种类}{The products are divided into several categories.}}
{{cautious}}{/ˈkɔːʃəs/}{谨慎的；小心的}{Investors are cautious about the volatile market.}}
{{ceremony}}{/ˈserɪməni/}{仪式；典礼}{The opening ceremony was a spectacular event.}}
{{certificate}}{/sərˈtɪfɪkət/}{证书；证明}{She received a certificate of completion.}}
{{character}}{/ˈkærəktər/}{性格；角色；文字}{Honesty is an admirable character trait.}}
{{charity}}{/ˈtʃærəti/}{慈善；施舍}{The charity raised over a million dollars for research.}}
{{chemical}}{/ˈkemɪkl/}{化学的；化学品}{Chemical pollution poses a threat to marine life.}}
{{chronic}}{/ˈkrɒnɪk/}{慢性的；长期的}{Chronic stress can lead to serious health problems.}}
{{circulate}}{/ˈsɜːkjuleɪt/}{循环；流通}{The news quickly circulated on social media.}}
{{civil}}{/ˈsɪvl/}{公民的；文明的}{Civil rights movements have shaped modern society.}}
{{civilian}}{/sɪˈvɪliən/}{平民；民用的}{The war caused thousands of civilian casualties.}}
{{clarify}}{/ˈklærɪfaɪ/}{澄清；阐明}{The speaker clarified the main points of her argument.}}
{{clause}}{/klɔːz/}{条款；从句}{The contract includes a confidentiality clause.}}
{{client}}{/ˈklaɪənt/}{客户；委托人}{The firm provides legal advice to corporate clients.}}
{{cling}}{/klɪŋ/}{紧握；依附}{Many people cling to traditional beliefs.}}
{{coincide}}{/ˌkəʊɪnˈsaɪd/}{巧合；一致}{The holiday coincides with the school vacation.}}
